(corpus-ch4-056)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *define new-var
    new-var = 0;
    if (time > 20) {
      ratio = pres / 2116.2;
      new-var = ratio * table(tbl-id);
    }
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when time>1 stop
*end
